# Any dated/backup copy of an env file, wherever it lands (2026-08-22:
# a real secrets-bearing .env.vtt.roll-drauf.de.bak.20260723_165703 was
# found sitting untracked in the repo root, not covered by the exact-name
# rules above — moved to /home/admin/backups/, this closes the pattern
# so a future one can never be `git add -A`ed by accident).
.env*.bak*
